### 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8096/actuator/health

### ---------- 注册商户端点 ----------

### 正常商户（指向本机 mock 接收端）
POST http://localhost:8096/api/merchants/mch_healthy/endpoints
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "http://localhost:8096/api/mock/receiver/ok",
  "secret": "whsec_demo",
  "eventTypes": []
}

### 恶意 URL：指向本机回环地址 —— 应被 SSRF 拦截，返回 400 SSRF_BLOCKED
POST http://localhost:8096/api/merchants/mch_evil/endpoints
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8096/api/mock/receiver/ok"
}

### 恶意 URL：指向云元数据服务 —— 应被 SSRF 拦截
POST http://localhost:8096/api/merchants/mch_evil/endpoints
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/"
}

### 恶意 URL：非 http/https —— 应被 SSRF 拦截
POST http://localhost:8096/api/merchants/mch_evil/endpoints
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "file:///etc/passwd"
}

### ---------- 发送内部事件 ----------

### 追问 1：发往恒定 500 的商户 -> 观察指数退避重试
POST http://localhost:8096/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantId": "mch_broken",
  "eventType": "charge.succeeded",
  "payload": "{\"amount\":1000,\"currency\":\"usd\"}"
}

### 追问 2：发往「接受连接后挂起 30 秒」的商户
POST http://localhost:8096/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantId": "mch_slowpoke",
  "eventType": "charge.succeeded",
  "payload": "{\"amount\":1000,\"currency\":\"usd\"}"
}

### 追问 2：同时给健康商户发一个事件 —— 它不会被上面的慢商户拖住
POST http://localhost:8096/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantId": "mch_healthy",
  "eventType": "customer.password_reset",
  "payload": "{\"userId\":\"u_1\"}"
}

### 追问 4：发往会计平台商户（接收端按事件 ID 幂等）
POST http://localhost:8096/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantId": "mch_accounting",
  "eventType": "charge.succeeded",
  "eventId": "evt_dup_demo_1",
  "payload": "{\"amount\":10000,\"currency\":\"usd\"}"
}

### 相同 eventId 再发一次 —— 平台侧幂等会直接返回同一条事件，不会投递两次
POST http://localhost:8096/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantId": "mch_accounting",
  "eventType": "charge.succeeded",
  "eventId": "evt_dup_demo_1",
  "payload": "{\"amount\":10000,\"currency\":\"usd\"}"
}

### ---------- 查询 ----------

### 查询事件状态
GET http://localhost:8096/api/events/evt_dup_demo_1

### 查询投递尝试流水（能看到每一次 500、每一次退避）
GET http://localhost:8096/api/events/evt_dup_demo_1/attempts

### 商户健康度：泳道 MAIN / SLOW / QUARANTINE + 断路器状态
GET http://localhost:8096/api/merchants/mch_slowpoke/health

### 全局视图：所有断路器状态与队列深度
GET http://localhost:8096/api/merchants/mch_healthy/health/global

### 死信队列
GET http://localhost:8096/api/dlq

### 重放死信
POST http://localhost:8096/api/dlq/evt_dup_demo_1/replay

### Mock 接收端统计（processedEventIds / duplicatesIgnored）
GET http://localhost:8096/api/mock/stats

### 重置 Mock 接收端
POST http://localhost:8096/api/mock/reset

### Prometheus 指标
GET http://localhost:8096/actuator/prometheus
